<Base title="About" description="Find Me CBR is a guide to Canberra, one suburb at a time, that shows what's been checked.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About Find Me CBR</h1>
    <p>Find Me CBR is a guide to Canberra, one suburb at a time, starting with Weston Creek and Molonglo Valley. We check what we publish, show you when we did, and say so when we don't know.</p>
    <p>Businesses can pay to be seen, but they can't pay to change what we say. Paid placements are always labelled Sponsored.</p>
    <p><em>[The owner's own story goes here.]</em></p>
    <p>Find Me CBR is run by FIND ME CBR, ABN 98 810 313 541.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="stack">
    <a class="rowtile" href="/how-we-check/"><span><Icon name="badge-check" class="lead" /><span>How we check</span></span><Icon name="chevron-right" /></a>
    <a class="rowtile" href="/advertise/"><span><Icon name="megaphone" class="lead" /><span>Advertise with us</span></span><Icon name="chevron-right" /></a>
  </div>
</Base>
